s=\"strong\">Trainer</span>:  Excellent, I'm glad to hear it. Do you have any questions to start?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Would it be possible to introduce me to some people in other departments?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Trainer</span>: Sure, that's a great idea. Come with me this way.", "id": 3, "time": "37500", "image": "engenn5le17ob05re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le17ob05re6aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le17ob05re6img01.jpg", "images": []}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally's On-The-Job Training"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Training the New Associate"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le17ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking Somebody's Opinion"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use the following phrases to ask somebody's opinion:<br><br>  What do you think about ... ? <br>  What's your opinion on ... ? <br>  Can I have your thoughts on ... ?<br>   What's your take on \u2026 ?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Trainer</span>: What do you think about the magazine?<br><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I love it. It's my favorite publication. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Trainer</span>: What's your opinion on the content?<br><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think it appeals to a wide audience and has a lot of very interesting articles."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making and Responding to Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "It's important to be polite when you ask for something or respond to requests. <br>You can make a request by using: <ul><li>Can you ... ?</li><li> Could you ... ?</li><li> Will you ... ? </li><li>Would you mind ... ? </li><li>Would it be possible to \u2026 ?</li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Making Requests \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could you remind me of your name? <br><br> Would it be possible to introduce me to some people in other departments?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure, here you are. <br><br>Yes, I'd love to!<br>That's a great idea.<br>I'm sorry, I can't do that right now.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to show the ropes"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to explain how something works to somebody new "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My job is to show you the ropes in the company. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you are on a training workshop."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to conduct "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to run; to lead "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll be conducting your training this morning. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "onboarding workshop"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "on-the-job training "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I hope this onboarding workshop will be useful for you. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "first impression"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the opinion you have after the first time you see something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I hope I'll leave you with a great first impression of our company."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "associate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person you work with"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: My job is to train you as a new associate."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "content"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the information found in a publication or online "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What's your opinion on the content?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Welcome the participants to the training session."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain the purpose of the training session."}, {"type": "text", "content": "One person makes a reasonable request. You accept."}, {"type": "text", "content": "One person makes an unreasonable request. You do not accept."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice the dialogue with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue with 6 - 8 lines."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I accept requests."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I refuse requests."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice the dialogue."}]}], "type": "sena"}